  "note": "The book uses (A.18) only for (A.32), |η₊′|₂ ≤ 10.845789, which is an input to Prop 9.4.2. Lean's η₊ explicit formula (TernaryGoldbach.Explicit.norm_SsumG_fP_le) needs only ∫η₊², ∫(log v)²η₊² and Mellin bounds on vertical lines, so neither (A.18) nor |η₊′|₂ appears."
